From 1e5f7e5d4e63844c55381d0e67fab49a941c99c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ncnynl <1043931@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 23 May 2026 19:25:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: consume A.triggered after paused toggle to prevent storm
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bug: vendor 用物理按键脉冲语义设计 A.triggered, 但 LLM 模式下
duck.start() 让 self.A_pressed=True 持续多帧 (没复位机制),
broadcast 100ms 周期 + RLWalk 50Hz 主循环, update_if_changed 在
is_pressed 不变时不替换 self.buttons -> self.buttons.A.triggered
持续 True -> RLWalk 每帧 toggle paused -> 翻烧饼.

Fix: 处理完 triggered 立刻 self.buttons.A.triggered = False (1 行).
单次 toggle, paused 稳定切换. 保留 vendor Arm/Disarm 设计哲学.

验证: ssh duck + python ws client 发 duck_start 之后 grep PAUSE/UNPAUSE,
应只 1 次 UNPAUSE (而非 5+ 次翻烧饼).
---
 scripts/v2_rl_walk_mujoco_mcp.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/scripts/v2_rl_walk_mujoco_mcp.py b/scripts/v2_rl_walk_mujoco_mcp.py
index 1abc97a..63bfebb 100644
--- a/scripts/v2_rl_walk_mujoco_mcp.py
+++ b/scripts/v2_rl_walk_mujoco_mcp.py
@@ -472,6 +472,7 @@ class RLWalk:
                             print("PAUSE")
                         else:
                             print("UNPAUSE")
+                        self.buttons.A.triggered = False
 
                 if self.paused:
                     time.sleep(0.1)
-- 
